    "title": "TSA Greenlights 200 Tortillas in Carry-On in Texas - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Texas\nTSA Greenlights 200 Tortillas in Carry-On in Texas\nBy Joanna Barba,5 minutes ago\nGreat news, fellow Texans, if you're traveling and need to take about 200 tortillas, TSA says that's totally okay!. A Texan's TikTok is going viral after one traveler confessed that her carry-on was packed with 200 tortillas- and sailed right through TSA! While the internet is having a field day with the clip, it turns out this isn’t exactly breaking news. The TSA actually gave tortillas the all-clear years ago, confirming that yes, you can bring as many as your bag (and your back) can handle!\nRelated Topics\nComments\nLoading editor...",
